Morning Stock Digest — Project Summary
A Python script that runs every weekday at 7am via GitHub Actions. It pulls price data and technicals (MA50/100/200, RSI, anomaly detection) from yfinance, scrapes Reuters for last 24h news per ticker, sends everything to Claude API for analysis, and delivers a formatted HTML email to your Gmail.
Stack: Python · yfinance · BeautifulSoup · Anthropic API (Gemini API free)· Gmail SMTP · GitHub Actions
No database. No server. No paid APIs.
5 files that matter:

prices.py — market data + technicals
news.py — Reuters scraper
analyst.py — Claude analysis + ratings
mailer.py — HTML email builder + sender
main.py — orchestrates everything

